<title>USA: Enserch Exploration names Hamilton CEO.</title>
<headline>Enserch Exploration names Hamilton CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enserch Exploration Inc said Monday it has named Thomas Hamilton as chairman, president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Hamilton was previously executive vice president and president of Pennzoil Co's Pennzoil Exploration &amp; Production Co, Enserch said.</p>
<p>Enserch said Hamilton would succeed Frederick Addy, who will continue as a director following his stint as interim chairman, president and CEO.</p>
</text>
